OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying fine
OL,6,Fand dry across the south this evening,
OL,7,Fwith cloud spreading in from the north
OL,8,Flater which might bring the odd shower
OL,9,Fto northern parts. Cloud will
OL,10,Fgradually push southward through the
OL,11,Fearly hours with clear spells to
OL,12,Ffollow.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FA grey start in the south but
OL,15,Fthis will gradually clear, leaving a
OL,16,Ffine and sunny day across the region.
OL,17,FFeeling warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
